 ## Proof
 
-1.1 If $h=0$, [F1] immediately returns `exact-identity`. Otherwise the position call in [F1] is the finite-budget supplier call in [F2], so it terminates after at most $N_q+1$ residual checks and $N_q$ corrections. If it returns any non-success status, the RATTLE routine returns immediately after finitely many further arithmetic operations. [F1, F2, given]
